          "en": "“I” is {{अहम्}}. For two it is {{आवाम्}} (we two), for many {{वयम्}} (we). The verb shows it too: {{अहं पठामि}} (I read), {{आवां पठावः}} (we two read), {{वयं पठामः}} (we read).",
