        "kind": "teach",
        "body": {
          "en": "Pāṇini calls the “I” person {{उत्तमः}}, “the highest”, and the “you” person {{मध्यमः}}, “the middle”. The “he, she, it” person, which you know already, is {{प्रथमः}}, “the first”. The names go in an order opposite to Hindi's.",
